{"id":"mahabharata-7-026","work":"mahabharata","part":7,"partName":"द्रोणपर्व","partNameEn":"Drona Parva","unit":26,"title":"षड्विंशतितमोऽध्यायः","titleEn":"Adhyaya 26 · Arjuna and the Samshaptakas, Krishna's sweat","summary":{"en":"Sanjaya tells what Arjuna did against the Samshaptakas while Drona pressed the Pandavas. When Krishna is tired and sweating, Arjuna destroys most of the Samshaptakas and turns to go against Bhagadatta.","kn":"ದ್ರೋಣ ಪಾಂಡವರನ್ನು ಒತ್ತುತ್ತಿದ್ದಾಗ ಅರ್ಜುನ ಸಂಶಪ್ತಕರ ವಿರುದ್ಧ ಏನು ಮಾಡಿದನೆಂದು ಸಂಜಯ ಹೇಳುತ್ತಾನೆ. ಕೃಷ್ಣ ದಣಿದು ಬೆವರಿದಾಗ ಅರ್ಜುನ ಹೆಚ್ಚಿನ ಸಂಶಪ್ತಕರನ್ನು ಕೊಂದು ಭಗದತ್ತನತ್ತ ತಿರುಗುತ್ತಾನೆ.","hi":"द्रोण जब पाण्डवों को दबा रहे थे तब अर्जुन ने संशप्तकों के विरुद्ध क्या किया, यह संजय बताते हैं। कृष्ण के थककर पसीने से भीगने पर अर्जुन अधिकांश संशप्तकों को मारकर भगदत्त की ओर बढ़ते हैं।","te":"ద్రోణుడు పాండవులను ఒత్తిడి చేస్తుండగా అర్జునుడు సంశప్తకులపై ఏం చేశాడో సంజయుడు చెబుతాడు. కృష్ణుడు అలసి చెమటపట్టగా అర్జునుడు చాలా మంది సంశప్తకులను చంపి భగదత్తుని వైపు తిరుగుతాడు.","ta":"த்ரோணர் பாண்டவரை நெருக்கும்போது அர்ஜுனன் சம்சப்தகரிடம் என்ன செய்தான் என்று சஞ்சயன் கூறுகிறான். கண்ணன் களைத்து வியர்க்க, அர்ஜுனன் பெரும்பாலான சம்சப்தகரைக் கொன்று பகதத்தனை நோக்கிச் செல்கிறான்.","ml":"ദ്രോണർ പാണ്ഡവരെ അമർത്തുമ്പോൾ അർജുനൻ സംശപ്തകരോട് ചെയ്തതത് സഞ്ജയൻ വിവരിക്കുന്നു. കൃഷ്ണൻ ക്ഷീണിച്ച് വിയർക്കുമ്പോൾ അർജുനൻ സംശപ്തകരിൽ മിക്കവരെയും നശിപ്പിക്കുന്നു; പിന്നീട് ഭഗദത്തനെതിരെ തിരിയുന്നു."},"source":"Mahabharata, Critical Edition (BORI, Pune) 7.26; e-text by M. Tokunaga and J. D. Smith, © BORI 1999, version of Tue Sep 22 2026","sections":[{"title":"संशप्तकवधपर्व","titleEn":"Samshaptakavadha Parva (Slaying of the Samshaptakas)","verses":[{"text":"संजय उवाच","meaning":{"en":"Sanjaya said:"}},{"n":1,"text":"यन्मां पार्थस्य संग्रामे कर्माणि परिपृच्छसि ।\nतच्छृणुष्व महाराज पार्थो यदकरोन्मृधे ॥","meaning":{"en":"You ask about Partha's deeds in battle; hear, great king, what Partha did in the fight."}},{"n":2,"text":"रजो दृष्ट्वा समुद्भूतं श्रुत्वा च गजनिस्वनम् ।\nभज्यतां भगदत्तेन कौन्तेयः कृष्णमब्रवीत् ॥","meaning":{"en":"Seeing the dust rise and hearing the elephant's trumpeting, the son of Kunti said to Krishna: \"Bhagadatta is shattering our army.\""}},{"n":3,"text":"यथा प्राग्ज्योतिषो राजा गजेन मधुसूदन ।\nत्वरमाणोऽभ्यतिक्रान्तो ध्रुवं तस्यैष निस्वनः ॥","meaning":{"en":"Madhusudana, the sound of Pragjyotisha's king rushing on his elephant is surely his."}},{"n":4,"text":"इन्द्रादनवरः संख्ये गजयानविशारदः ।\nप्रथमो वा द्वितीयो वा पृथिव्यामिति मे मतिः ॥","meaning":{"en":"In battle, in elephant warfare, he is no less than Indra, I believe; he is the first or the second on earth."}},{"n":5,"text":"स चापि द्विरदश्रेष्ठः सदाप्रतिगजो युधि ।\nसर्वशब्दातिगः संख्ये कृतकर्मा जितक्लमः ॥","meaning":{"en":"And his best of elephants has always been a match for any elephant, beyond all noise in battle, trained in war and untiring."}},{"n":6,"text":"सहः शस्त्रनिपातानामग्निस्पर्शस्य चानघ ।\nस पाण्डवबलं व्यक्तमद्यैको नाशयिष्यति ॥","meaning":{"en":"Sinless one, it can bear the fall of weapons and the touch of fire. Clearly that one alone will destroy the Pandava army today."}},{"n":7,"text":"न चावाभ्यामृतेऽन्योऽस्ति शक्तस्तं प्रतिबाधितुम् ।\nत्वरमाणस्ततो याहि यतः प्राग्ज्योतिषाधिपः ॥","meaning":{"en":"Apart from the two of us, no one else can stop him. So go quickly where the king of Pragjyotisha is."}},{"n":8,"text":"शक्रसख्याद्द्विपबलैर्वयसा चापि विस्मितम् ।\nअद्यैनं प्रेषयिष्यामि बलहन्तुः प्रियातिथिम् ॥","meaning":{"en":"He is proud of his friendship with Shakra, of his elephant force and of his age. Today I shall send him as a dear guest to the slayer of Bala."}},{"n":9,"text":"वचनादथ कृष्णस्तु प्रययौ सव्यसाचिनः ।\nदार्यते भगदत्तेन यत्र पाण्डववाहिनी ॥","meaning":{"en":"At his word, Krishna drove the chariot of Savyasachi to where Bhagadatta was tearing the Pandava army apart."}},{"n":10,"text":"तं प्रयान्तं ततः पश्चादाह्वयन्तो महारथाः ।\nसंशप्तकाः समारोहन्सहस्राणि चतुर्दश ॥","meaning":{"en":"As he went, the great chariot-warriors, the Samshaptakas, challenging him from behind, came after him, fourteen thousand of them."}},{"n":11,"text":"दशैव तु सहस्राणि त्रिगर्तानां नराधिप ।\nचत्वारि तु सहस्राणि वासुदेवस्य येऽनुगाः ॥","meaning":{"en":"There were ten thousand Trigartas, O king, and four thousand who were followers of Vasudeva."}},{"n":12,"text":"दार्यमाणां चमूं दृष्ट्वा भगदत्तेन मारिष ।\nआहूयमानस्य च तैरभवद्धृदयं द्विधा ॥","meaning":{"en":"Seeing his army being torn apart by Bhagadatta, and being challenged by them, Arjuna's heart was divided in two, O sir."}},{"n":13,"text":"किं नु श्रेयस्करं कर्म भवेदिति विचिन्तयन् ।\nइतो वा विनिवर्तेयं गच्छेयं वा युधिष्ठिरम् ॥","meaning":{"en":"He wondered what would be the better course: to turn back from here, or to go to Yudhishthira."}},{"n":14,"text":"तस्य बुद्ध्या विचार्यैतदर्जुनस्य कुरूद्वह ।\nअभवद्भूयसी बुद्धिः संशप्तकवधे स्थिरा ॥","meaning":{"en":"Considering this in his mind, Arjuna, O bull of the Kurus, became firmly resolved to kill the Samshaptakas."}},{"n":15,"text":"स संनिवृत्तः सहसा कपिप्रवरकेतनः ।\nएको रथसहस्राणि निहन्तुं वासवी रणे ॥","meaning":{"en":"Then suddenly turning back, the Indra's son whose banner bore the chief of apes resolved alone to destroy those thousands of chariots in battle."}},{"n":16,"text":"सा हि दुर्योधनस्यासीन्मतिः कर्णस्य चोभयोः ।\nअर्जुनस्य वधोपाये तेन द्वैधमकल्पयत् ॥","meaning":{"en":"That plan was Duryodhana's and Karna's both, to bring about Arjuna's death; so Arjuna's mind was split in two."}},{"n":17,"text":"स तु संवर्तयामास द्वैधीभावेन पाण्डवः ।\nरथेन तु रथाग्र्याणामकरोत्तां मृषा तदा ॥","meaning":{"en":"The Pandava carried out his purpose even so divided; but he made the plan of those best of chariot-warriors vain by his chariot."}},{"n":18,"text":"ततः शतसहस्राणि शराणां नतपर्वणाम् ।\nव्यसृजन्नर्जुने राजन्संशप्तकमहारथाः ॥","meaning":{"en":"Then the great chariot-warriors, the Samshaptakas, loosed hundreds of thousands of straight-jointed arrows at Arjuna, O king."}},{"n":19,"text":"नैव कुन्तीसुतः पार्थो नैव कृष्णो जनार्दनः ।\nन हया न रथो राजन्दृश्यन्ते स्म शरैश्चिताः ॥","meaning":{"en":"Neither Partha, son of Kunti, nor Krishna Janardana, nor the horses, nor the chariot, O king, could be seen, covered with arrows."}},{"n":20,"text":"यदा मोहमनुप्राप्तः सस्वेदश्च जनार्दनः ।\nततस्तान्प्रायशः पार्थो वज्रास्त्रेण निजघ्निवान् ॥","meaning":{"en":"When Janardana was bewildered and sweating, Partha slew most of them with the thunderbolt weapon."}},{"n":21,"text":"शतशः पाणयश्छिन्नाः सेषुज्यातलकार्मुकाः ।\nकेतवो वाजिनः सूता रथिनश्चापतन्क्षितौ ॥","meaning":{"en":"Hands by the hundreds, with arrows, bowstrings, finger-guards and bows, were cut off, and banners, horses, charioteers and chariot-warriors fell to the ground."}},{"n":22,"text":"द्रुमाचलाग्राम्बुधरैः समरूपाः सुकल्पिताः ।\nहतारोहाः क्षितौ पेतुर्द्विपाः पार्थशराहताः ॥","meaning":{"en":"Elephants, well arrayed and looking like trees, mountains, hills and clouds, fell to the ground struck by Partha's arrows, their riders slain."}},{"n":23,"text":"विप्रविद्धकुथावल्गाश्छिन्नभाण्डाः परासवः ।\nसारोहास्तुरगाः पेतुर्मथिताः पार्थमार्गणैः ॥","meaning":{"en":"Horses with their riders fell, their saddle-cloths and harness torn, their trappings cut, lifeless, crushed by Partha's arrows."}},{"n":24,"text":"सर्ष्टिचर्मासिनखराः समुद्गरपरश्वधाः ।\nसंछिन्ना बाहवः पेतुर्नृणां भल्लैः किरीटिना ॥","meaning":{"en":"The arms of men, with their spears, shields, swords, claws, maces and axes, were cut off by Arjuna's broad-headed arrows and fell."}},{"n":25,"text":"बालादित्याम्बुजेन्दूनां तुल्यरूपाणि मारिष ।\nसंछिन्नान्यर्जुनशरैः शिरांस्युर्वीं प्रपेदिरे ॥","meaning":{"en":"O sir, heads like the young sun, lotuses and the moon, cut off by Arjuna's arrows, fell on the earth."}},{"n":26,"text":"जज्वालालंकृतैः सेना पत्रिभिः प्राणभोजनैः ।\nनानालिङ्गैस्तदामित्रान्क्रुद्धे निघ्नति फल्गुने ॥","meaning":{"en":"When angry Arjuna struck his enemies, the army blazed with adorned, life-devouring arrows of many marks."}},{"n":27,"text":"क्षोभयन्तं तदा सेनां द्विरदं नलिनीमिव ।\nधनंजयं भूतगणाः साधु साध्वित्यपूजयन् ॥","meaning":{"en":"The hosts of spirits cheered \"Well done, well done!\" for Dhananjaya as he threw that army into turmoil like an elephant in a lotus pond."}},{"n":28,"text":"दृष्ट्वा तत्कर्म पार्थस्य वासवस्येव माधवः ।\nविस्मयं परमं गत्वा तलमाहत्य पूजयत् ॥","meaning":{"en":"Seeing that deed of Partha, as of Indra, Madhava was filled with great wonder and clapped his palms in praise."}},{"n":29,"text":"ततः संशप्तकान्हत्वा भूयिष्ठं ये व्यवस्थिताः ।\nभगदत्ताय याहीति पार्थः कृष्णमचोदयत् ॥","meaning":{"en":"Then, having slain most of the Samshaptakas who stood there, Partha urged Krishna: \"Go to Bhagadatta.\""}}]}]}